 "summary": "Invoice PDFs render with WeasyPrint (invoice-pdf-v2); font set by @font-face in src/billing/pdf.py",
 "content": "`render_pdf()` in src/billing/pdf.py renders invoice PDFs with WeasyPrint. The `invoice-pdf-v2` flag in flags.toml must be on; the old wkhtmltopdf/pdfkit renderer was removed. The font is set in the module-level `_STYLE` CSS: an `@font-face` rule that loads Inter from `url(assets/Inter.woff2)` and applies it to `body`, using a shared `FontConfiguration` (`_FONTS`). To change the font, edit that CSS, not the Dockerfile. As of 2026-10-04, assets/Inter.woff2 does not exist in the repo, and the relative URL has no base_url, so WeasyPrint falls back to a system font.",
